        w.println('| Damage formula | `(dmg + extra + buffed flat dmg + flat bonuses) * map mult * (1 + % bonuses) * type & situation multipliers` -> immunities (Sharp vs Lead, Explosive vs undetected Camo) -> `x (1 - armour x (1 - armourPierce))` -> BFB weak-hit halving -> Heap shield halving -> `x (1 + % mark) + flat mark` -> `+ min(cap, pct x maxHP)`; Frozen enemies take x2, Fortified enemies take x2 while Armor Cracked |')
        w.println('| Status effects | SLOW: strongest applies, never stacks, bosses get 1/3 of any slow. STUN/FREEZE: bosses immune unless the tower says otherwise. MARKED: flat (+N) and percent (+X%) marks, strongest of each kind applies. KNOCKBACK: along the waypoint path only, bosses immune unless stated. BURN: refreshes, never stacks. ARMOR CRACK: removes Lead immunity and the Fortified HP bonus is ignored (modelled as x2 damage vs Fortified) |')
        w.println('| Buff stacking | same source tower type never stacks (highest wins); different types add. Caps: +100% attack speed, +10 pierce, +5 flat damage |')
        w.println("| Camo detection | built-in: Bellarmine Student + AI, Grok, Perplexity; gained at U2: Gemini, Llama; any tower within Perplexity's radius; every tower while a Perplexity U1+ exists |")
